OL,3,ACrimea bridge shut after reported
OL,4,AUkrainian strike, as Russia hits Kyiv
OL,5,Acrossings
OL,6,
OL,7,FA key bridge linking occupied Crimea
OL,8,Fand Russia is closed after reports a
OL,9,FUkrainian strike inflicted major
OL,10,Fdamage, during a night in which the
OL,11,Fwarring countries both targeted major
OL,12,Fcrossings.
OL,14,FA former adviser to Ukrainian President
OL,15,FVolodymyr Zelensky shared images
OL,16,Fpurporting to show that a section of
OL,17,Fthe Crimea bridge - also known as the
OL,18,FKerch Bridge - had collapsed into the
OL,19,Fwater.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
