OL,3,ACrimea bridge shut after reported
OL,4,AUkrainian strike, as Russia hits Kyiv
OL,5,Acrossings
OL,6,
OL,7,FMeanwhile, Kyiv Mayor Vitali Klitschko
OL,8,Fsaid the Northern and Southern bridges,
OL,9,Fimportant routes over the Dnipro River,
OL,10,Fwere closed after Russian ballistic
OL,11,Fmissile strikes.
OL,13,FThose attacks came a day after Ukraine
OL,14,Fbegan its most recent attempt to
OL,15,Fdisable the Crimea bridge, a prized
OL,16,FKremlin asset seen as a symbol of
OL,17,FRussia's occupation.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
